{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Melrose Figueroa, hot-headed and foolhardy in pursuit of finding love for himself. After experiencing one of the craziest nights of his life and a near-death experience, Melrose is convinced that he\u00a0is cursed, and Eros, the god of love, is to blame.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If only he could kill him and put an end to the never-ending cycle- surely a pipe dream for a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, he is passed a family heirloom, one that gives him the ability to see higher beings, along with another valuable purpose. The reality of a new world opens up before him, and suddenly, the bizarre idea might actually sound plausible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the story that unfolds and discover a shocking truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will he succeed in killing Eros and finding true love?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or does fate have other plans?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047480/extras/982008da2392dfc3dd6f3a520faaf93d.avif?t=1768976716\" width=600 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Melrose Figueroa - Main Protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047480/extras/933523ac419ab5fbc4b9ba3f4c3cf82a.avif?t=1768976716\" width=600 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Icardi - The Scouting Cupid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img